SUMMARY:Pumpkins & Dots! \nAcrylic on Canvas
DESCRIPTION:Full Circle Studio - Creative Arts\nDots! Painting Pumpkins\nA
 crylic paint on canvas!\nArtsy addition to your Fall decor!\n\n***MUST REG
 ISTER ON TARA’S WEBSITE***\nhttps://www.taradickinson.com/classes/art-cl
 asses\n🧡💛🧡💛\n_________________________________\n\nIn this begi
 nner's workshop\, you'll paint pumpkins and then intricate dots for this A
 rt Deco style expression.\n\nFollowing in the famous footsteps of artist Y
 ayoi Kusama’s pumpkins\, we're going to paint our own canvas with autumn
  harvest gourds & a variety of magical dots!\n\nI'm sure you've seen them:
  gorgeous patterns of different-sized dots painted on all shapes of pumpki
 ns.\n\nOur expression will be a little less intricate but still wonderful!
 \n\nDATE & TIME: Tuesday Oct. 27th\, 4:00 - 6:30 PM\n\n*NOTE: You could ab
 solutely come at 5:00 & get done! I'll be there by 4:00 PM\, so if you wan
 t to go slower & add lots of detail\, you'll have time.\n\n$35.00
