SUMMARY:Angels for all Occasions 2-day event
DESCRIPTION:Full Circle Studio - Creative Arts\n**Angels for Any Occasion 
 – 2-Day Event Nov 14 & 28\\***\n***💰 Cost: $65(all materials)***\n\n
 📅 **Dates:** Nov. 14 & 28th\\*\, 2026\n📍 **Location:** Full Circle S
 tudio\, 360 Tesconi Circle Ste C\, Santa Rosa\, CA\n👥 **Ages:** 16+\n\n
 Join us for a hands-on clay workshop at **Full Circle Studio 360!** In thi
 s two-day event\, you'll make an Angel to fit into your life\, whether a h
 oliday angel\, and angel of a different culture in a simple and quick way\
 , bring your own idea and we can figure it out\, our use one of my pattern
 s. On Nov. 10th\, we will make the image from clay and then it will be fir
 ed and you will return on Nov. 28th to Glaze. \\*This is Thanksgiving week
 end and if you can't make the glaze day\, we can arrange another Saturday 
 for you to glaze.\n\nThis is a great opportunity to explore your creativit
 y\, meet fellow art lovers\, and take home a unique handmade piece! No pri
 or experience needed. However\, some additional teaching around creating a
  face for you angel for those ready for that next step.\n\n🎟️ **Limit
 ed spots available – reserve your space today!**
